Your hunger for violence and suffering sustains you.  All damage you do heals you for a portion of the damage done, from [0%, 1%, 1%, 1%, 1% (TL1-5)] (at 0 Hate to) [4%, 6%, 7%, 8%, 9% (TL1-5)] (at max Hate).  You can recover no more than 1/6 of your max life each turn this way.

Each point in Bloodstained talents reduces the amount of damage you take from bleed effects by 2%
